      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "每个视图唯一的主操作：奶油底棕字，底部压着 5px 沙色厚度，按下会落回去。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\">提交申请</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:45px;padding:0 20px;border:2px solid var(--animal-bg-color,#f8f8f0);border-radius:50px;background:var(--animal-bg-color,#f8f8f0);color:var(--animal-text-color,#794f27);font-family:var(--animal-font-family,Nunito,\"Noto Sans SC\",sans-serif);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 5px 0 0 #bdaea0;transition:all .25s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}.ds-btn-primary:hover{box-shadow:0 6px 0 0 #bdaea0;transform:translateY(-1px)}.ds-btn-primary:active{box-shadow:0 1px 0 0 #bdaea0;transform:translateY(2px)}.ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--animal-text-color,#794f27);outline-offset:2px}"
