      "description": "门户入口卡：可点击的卡片只在 hover 时上浮 2px；名称 18/700，摘要最多两行，右上角薄荷箭头。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-service-card\"><span class=\"ds-service-name\">签注申请署</span><span class=\"ds-service-desc\">办理入境签注、补件与电子签注核验</span><svg class=\"ds-service-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M19 12 L 31 24 L 19 36\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-service-card{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;width:280px;padding:16px 24px;border:0;border-radius:20px;background:#f7f3df;color:var(--animal-text-color,#794f27);text-align:left;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--animal-font-family,Nunito,\"Noto Sans SC\",sans-serif);transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}.ds-service-card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}.ds-service-card:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--animal-text-color,#794f27);outline-offset:2px}.ds-service-name{padding-right:28px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35}.ds-service-desc{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.55;color:#725d42;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}.ds-service-arrow{position:absolute;top:18px;right:20px;color:var(--animal-primary-color,#19c8b9)}"
